    <div class="col">

        <h2>Intra-State vs Inter-State GST for Services</h2>

        <h5>Intra-State (Same State)</h5>
        <p>CGST + SGST applied equally.</p>

        <h5>Inter-State (Different State)</h5>
        <p>IGST applied at full rate.</p>

        <p>The place of supply determines which tax applies. Incorrect classification can lead to compliance issues.</p>

    </div>
</div>

